。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"2556\",\"name\":\"斯塔缇克狂热\",\"picture\":\"s4\/equip\/2556.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s4\/equip\/2556.png\",\"planID\":\"6\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"2667\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"2668\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+10%攻击速度 +20护甲\",\"desc\":\"+10%攻击速度 +20护甲\\n\\n当携带者攻击或受到伤害时，获得可叠加的4攻击力和法术强度。这个效果最多叠加25次，且叠满后携带者会获得50护甲和魔法抗性。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"2557\",\"name\":\"泰坦的誓言\",\"picture\":\"s4\/equip\/2557.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s4\/equip\/2557.png\",\"planID\":\"6\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"2668\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"2669\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+40%攻击速度 +20魔法抗性 +10攻击力\",\"desc\":\"+40%攻击速度 +20魔法抗性 +10攻击力\\n\\n携带者获得10攻击力。携带者的攻击会对附近的另一名敌人发射一个额外的弹体，造成携带者110%攻击力的物理伤害。 光明加成：+30%攻击速度\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"2558\",\"name\":\"卢安娜的风暴\",\"picture\":\"s4\/equip\/2558.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s4\/equip\/2558.png\",\"planID\":\"6\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"2669\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"2670\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+10%攻击速度 +150生命上限\",\"desc\":\"+10%攻击速度 +150生命上限\\n\\n在战斗环节开始时，一个带有额外生命值和攻击力的光明版【虚空之母】会爬起来嘲讽附近4格内的敌人。从召唤单位上爬起来的光明版【虚空之母】效能为25%。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"2559\",\"name\":\"兹若特的干涉\",\"picture\":\"s4\/equip\/2559.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s4\/equip\/2559.png\",\"planID\":\"6\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"2670\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"2671\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+120%法术强度\",\"desc\":\"+120%法术强度\\n\\n提供120额外法术强度(包含基础装备)。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"2560\",\"name\":\"班克斯的飞升之帽\",\"picture\":\"s4\/equip\/2560.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s4\/equip\/2560.png\",\"planID\":\"6\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"2671\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"2672\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+10%