个满是成装的武器库！你将有30秒时间来进行选择。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"3508\",\"name\":\"成装锻造器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/3508.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/3508.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3009\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"将此物拖拽至商店，即可打开一个满是神器的武器库！你将有30秒时间来进行选择。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"3509\",\"name\":\"神器装备锻造器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/3509.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/3509.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3010\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"用在一位3阶或以下的英雄身上，即可生成一个该英雄的1星版本到你的备战区。  [消耗品-这个物品会在使用后消失]\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"3710\",\"name\":\"次级英雄复制器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/3710.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/3710.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3019\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"用在一位英雄身上即可取下其所有装备，次数不限。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"golden_remover\",\"name\":\"金制拆卸器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/golden_remover.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/golden_remover.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3020\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"用在一位英雄身上即可开启一个武器库，包含该弈子可合成成装的光明版本。将你所选的装备升级为光明版，并将其卸下。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"masterwork_upgrade\",\"name\":\"杰作升级\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/masterwork_upgrade.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/masterwork_upgrade.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3028\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"对一个弈子使用，即可移除其所有装备并将它们拆解为基础装备。  [消耗品-这个装备会在使用后消失。]\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"salvager\",\"name\":\"打捞术\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/salvager.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/salvager.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"-1\"},\"3029\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"用在一个弈子身上即可开启一个武器库，包含为其特别定制的装备。  这些装备都是基于该弈子的推荐装备。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"luckyitemchest\",\"name\":\"幸运装备宝箱\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/luckyitemchest.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/luckyitemchest.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"3030\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"用在一个弈子身上即可开启一个特别适合该弈子的光明武器库。  这些装备都是基于该弈子的推荐装备。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"radiantluckyitemchest\",\"name\":\"光明版幸运装备宝箱\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/radiantluckyitemchest.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/radiantluckyitemchest.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"3101\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"放置在一个英雄身上，以创造一个该英雄的1星版本到你的备战区。这么做会消耗掉【妮蔻之助】[消耗品-这个装备会在被使用后消失]\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"3001\",\"name\":\"妮蔻之助\",\"picture\":\"s3\/equip\/3001.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s3\/equip\/3001.png\",\"planID\":\"1\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"3101\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"3104\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"在一位英雄身上使用，使用后可使商店进行一次特殊刷新，该次刷新会刷新出5张2星棋子[消耗品-这个装备会在被使用后消失]\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"3104\",\"name\":\"快速成长培养皿\",\"picture\":\"s3\/equip\/3104.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/s3\/equip\/3104.png\",\"planID\":\"1\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"3104\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"3105\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"在一位英雄身上使用，使用后可使商店进行一次特殊刷新，该次刷新会刷新出与上次商店相同的