n处决生命值低于44%的敌人。技能可以造成暴击。获得44%暴击伤害。  推荐使用者：【烬】和【泽丽】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"pulsesilencer\",\"name\":\"脉冲消音器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/pulsesilencer.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/pulsesilencer.png\",\"planID\":\"14\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9146\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+100护甲 +100魔法抗性\",\"desc\":\"+100护甲 +100魔法抗性\\n\\n技能和攻击会标记敌人10秒。被标记的敌人受到伤害时，会为携带者回复相当于75%造成伤害的生命值。  推荐使用者：【瑟庄妮】、【贾克斯】、【莫德凯撒】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"hijackedcybercoil\",\"name\":\"被劫持的赛博线圈\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/hijackedcybercoil.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/hijackedcybercoil.png\",\"planID\":\"14\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9147\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+30%攻击力 +50%攻击速度\",\"desc\":\"+30%攻击力 +50%攻击速度\\n\\n每隔一次攻击会获得充能，造成目标20%最大生命值的物理伤害和15护甲削减。  推荐使用者：【泽丽】和【纳亚菲利】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"fullychargedfluxcapacitor\",\"name\":\"满电量的通量电容器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/fullychargedfluxcapacitor.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/fullychargedfluxcapacitor.png\",\"planID\":\"14\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9148\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+30法力值 +40法术强度 +20%攻击速度\",\"desc\":\"+30法力值 +40法术强度 +20%攻击速度\\n\\n攻击在暴击时提供10额外法力值。在施放技能后，获得持续8秒的100%暴击几率。  推荐使用者：【韦鲁斯】、【烬】、【泽丽】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"scopedholobow\",\"name\":\"全息瞄准镜\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/scopedholobow.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/scopedholobow.png\",\"planID\":\"14\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9149\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+400生命上限\",\"desc\":\"+400生命上限\\n\\n携带者身上的所有护盾效果提升100%。每一秒，从相距最近的3个敌人处虹吸携带者的8%最大生命值，并将其转化为持续8秒的护盾值。  推荐使用者：【莫德凯撒】、【贾克斯】、【瑟庄妮】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"harmonizedchassis\",\"name\":\"协调底盘\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/harmonizedchassis.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/harmonizedchassis.png\",\"planID\":\"14\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9165\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"战力强化：用在一个弈子上，即可选择一项【战力强化】！  售出该弈子或使用一个【强化果实移除器】，即可重获一颗【强化果实】。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"powersnax\",\"name\":\"强化果实\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/powersnax.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/powersnax.png\",\"planID\":\"15\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9166\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"对一个弈子使用，即可移除其【战力强化】并重新获得一个【强化果实】。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"powerremover\",\"name\":\"强化果实移除器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/powerremover.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/powerremover.png\",\"planID\":\"15\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9167\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+300生命上限 +30%攻击速度\",\"desc\":\"+300生命上限 +30%攻击速度\\n\\n如果携带者是一个【坦克】，则每2秒回复3-21%最大生命值(基于阶段)。如果不是，则转而每2秒获得10%物理加成和法术加成。  如果这件装备的携带者倒下，那么你会立刻输掉战斗。  你可以通过将携带者移到备战席来移除这个装备。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"6901\",\"name\":\"德玛西亚王冠\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/6901.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/6901.png\",\"planID\":\"17\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9168\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"【超级战队】弈子们治疗【超级机甲】，数额相当于他们12%的伤害值。  将我们的力量组合起来！\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"combinationcore\",\"name\":\"组合核心\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/combinationcore.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/combinationcore.png\",\"planID\":\"15\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9169\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+25法术加成\",\"desc\":\"+25法术加成\\n\\n攻击会顺劈一个锥形区域，对邻格的敌人们造成50%物理伤害。  我们以不破决心斩除邪恶！\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"mightyblade\",\"name\":\"强力剑刃\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/mightyblade.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/mightyblade.png\",\"planID\":\"15\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9170\":{\"basicDesc\":\"+25%攻击速度 +10%全能吸血\",\"desc\":\"+25%攻击速度 +10%全能吸血\\n\\n造成额外真实伤害，数额相当于10%的所有造成伤害值。  降下正义剑刃！\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"megabladeupgrade\",\"name\":\"究极剑刃升级\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/megabladeupgrade.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/megabladeupgrade.png\",\"planID\":\"15\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9181\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +20物理加成 +20法术加成\",\"desc\":\" +20物理加成 +20法术加成\\n\\n攻击和技能将处决生命值低于12%的敌人。击杀时，获得10%物理加成和10%法术加成。  推荐携带者：【格雷福斯】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"deadmansdagger\",\"name\":\"亡者的短剑\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/deadmansdagger.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/deadmansdagger.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9182\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +10物理加成 +20%暴击率\",\"desc\":\" +10物理加成 +20%暴击率\\n\\n每1秒，获得3%物理加成和3%攻击速度。  推荐携带者：【厄运小姐】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"firstmatesflintlock\",\"name\":\"大副的燧发枪\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/firstmatesflintlock.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/firstmatesflintlock.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9183\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +300生命上限 +35护甲 +35魔法抗性\",\"desc\":\" +300生命上限 +35护甲 +35魔法抗性\\n\\n高于50%最大生命值时，从该装备中获得的护甲和魔抗加成翻倍。  每4秒，对相距最近的2名敌人造成相当于50%当前护甲和魔抗总值的魔法伤害。  推荐携带者：【诺提勒斯】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"barknuckles\",\"name\":\"酒吧指虎\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/barknuckles.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/barknuckles.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9184\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +600生命上限\",\"desc\":\" +600生命上限\\n\\n每7秒，治疗15%最大生命值并摆脱所有负面效果。在15秒后，获得10【银蛇币】。  推荐携带者：【俄洛伊】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"pileocitrus\",\"name\":\"成堆柑橘\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/pileocitrus.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/pileocitrus.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9185\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +20%暴击率 +20%攻击速度\",\"desc\":\" +20%暴击率 +20%攻击速度\\n\\n参与击杀后，生成一个额外的1【银蛇币】。(已赚取：0)  推荐携带者：【普朗克】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"luckydoubloon\",\"name\":\"幸运达布隆金币\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/luckydoubloon.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/luckydoubloon.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9186\":{\"basicDesc\":\" +100生命上限 +10物理加成 +10法术加成\",\"desc\":\" +100生命上限 +10物理加成 +10法术加成\\n\\n攻击和技能将【灼烧】和【冰冷】敌人2秒。  推荐携带者：【崔斯特】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"captainsbrew\",\"name\":\"船长的酿造品\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/captainsbrew.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/captainsbrew.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9187\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"替换黑市中的所有物品！\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"blackmarketrestock\",\"name\":\"黑市补货\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/blackmarketrestock.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/blackmarketrestock.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9188\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"对一个3费或以下的【比尔吉沃特】弈子使用，即可生成一个该弈子的1星版本到你的备战区。\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bilgewaterlesserchampionduplicator\",\"name\":\"比尔吉沃特次级英雄复制器\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/bilgewaterlesserchampionduplicator.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/bilgewaterlesserchampionduplicator.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9199\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"获得200+10%生命值。在生命值跌下50%最大生命值时，召唤1个拥有该弈子30%最大生命值的虚灵。获得400+20%HP。当生命值首次降低至50%时，召唤1个拥有该弈子60%最大生命值的虚灵。  推荐使用者：【科加斯】和【峡谷先锋】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"royalhusk\",\"name\":\"皇室外壳\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/royalhusk.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/royalhusk.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9200\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"获得200最大生命值，获得最大生命值0.5%的护甲和魔抗。获得400最大生命值，获得最大生命值1.1%的护甲和魔抗。  推荐使用者：【科加斯】、【雷克塞】和【峡谷先锋】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"ironcarapace\",\"name\":\"坚铁甲壳\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/ironcarapace.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/ironcarapace.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9201\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"造成实际伤害的15%会治疗生命值百分比最低的友军。 对一名敌人造成伤害后，从其身上窃取2%的物理加成和法术加成，至多叠加10层(来自所有来源)。造成实际伤害的30%会治疗生命值百分比最低的友军。 一名敌人造成伤害后，从其身上窃取4%的物理加成和法术加成，至多叠加10层(来自所有来源)。  推荐使用者：【克格莫】、【玛尔扎哈】和【卡莎】\",\"fetterID\":\"\",\"icon\":\"leechingnucleus\",\"name\":\"榨血核体\",\"picture\":\"gamedata\/equip\/leechingnucleus.png\",\"fullPicture\":\"https:\/\/game.gtimg.cn\/images\/lol\/act\/jkzlk\/gamedata\/equip\/leechingnucleus.png\",\"planID\":\"16\",\"synthesis1\":\"0\",\"synthesis2\":\"0\",\"tftEquipId\":\"0\",\"type\":\"特殊装备\"},\"9202\":{\"basicDesc\":\"\",\"desc\":\"造成1000点伤害后，向2名相距最近的敌人发射